flowchart LR
    P([PDF invoices]) --> R{Text layer?}
    R -->|yes| T[Text extraction]
    R -->|scan| V[Page images]
    T --> X[LLM extraction<br/>JSON schema + retry]
    V --> X
    X --> C1[Business rules<br/>math · VAT/AFM · IBAN · dates]
    X --> C2[Grounding<br/>every value in source?]
    X --> C3[History<br/>duplicates · outliers]
    C1 & C2 & C3 --> D{Decision}
    D -->|clean + confident| A([Auto-approved])
    D -->|any doubt| H([Human review queue])
    D -->|same invoice twice| B([Blocked duplicate])
    H -->|approve / correct| A
    A --> E[(SQLite → CSV / Excel / dashboard)]
